<h2 id="figure-register">Register of figures</h2>
<p>The figures used in the text of the pages, {{ figures | length }} in all. The year-by-year history, the detailed tables, the example budgets and the calculator's scenarios are kept in their own records, and each shows its source where it is used.</p>
<details class="more">
  <summary>Show the register of figures</summary>
  {% call m.scrollTable() %}
  <table>
    <caption>Register of figures</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Figure</th><th scope="col" class="num">Value</th><th scope="col">Period</th><th scope="col">Kind</th><th scope="col">First caveat</th><th scope="col">Where</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Checked</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {%- for id, record in figures %}
      {%- set fg = id | figure %}
      <tr id="fig-{{ id }}"><th scope="row">{{ fg.label }}</th><td class="num">{{ fg.shown }}</td><td>{{ fg.period_label }}</td><td>{{ m.kindLine(fg.classification, fg.provisional, fg.source.status) }}</td><td>{{ (fg.qualifications | splitCaveat)[0] }}</td><td>{{ fg.geography }}</td><td>{{ m.cite(fg.source, true) }}. {{ fg.table_reference }}</td><td>{{ fg.checked_date | timeTag | safe }}</td></tr>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endcall %}
</details>

<h2 id="claim-register">Register of claims</h2>
<p>Statements that are not figures, {{ claims | length }} in all, each with the passage it rests on. "Our reading" marks a statement that includes interpretation or reports a judgement.</p>
<details class="more">
  <summary>Show the register of claims</summary>
  {% call m.scrollTable() %}
  <table>
    <caption>Register of claims</caption>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Statement</th><th scope="col">Kind</th><th scope="col">What the source says</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {%- for id, record in claims %}
      {%- set cl = id | claim %}
      <tr id="claim-{{ id }}"><th scope="row">{{ cl.statement }}</th><td>{{ { "rule": "Published rule", "enacted": "In law or a government document", "commitment": "Commitment", "proposal": "Proposal", "reported": "Reported", "commentary": "Commentary", "finding": "Research or official finding", "recommendation": "Recommendation", "not-found": "Not found" }[cl.kind] }}{% if cl.interpretation %}. Our reading or a judgement{% endif %}</td><td>{% if cl.passage %}"{{ cl.passage }}"{% else %}No passage quoted{% endif %}</td><td>{% if cl.source %}{{ m.cite(cl.source, true) }}{% else %}A record of a search. No source can show that something does not exist.{% endif %}</td><td>{{ cl.note or "" }}</td></tr>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% endcall %}
</details>

